====Pronunciation====
* {{ru-IPA|к}} {{q|before vowels, voiceless consonants and half of voiced consonants}}
* {{ru-IPA|г/}} {{q|before the voiced consonants {{m|ru|б}}, {{m|ru|г}}, {{m|ru|д}}, {{m|ru|ж}} and {{m|ru|з}}}}
* {{ru-IPA|кə}} {{q|before pauses}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-к.ogg}}

====Preposition====
{{head|ru|preposition}} {{+obj|ru|dat|catpos=prep}}

# [[to]], [[toward]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''к''' [[дом|до́му]]|'''to''' the [[house]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''к''' [[брат|бра́ту]]|'''to''' (my) [[brother]]}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''ко''' [[я|мне]]|'''to''' [[me]]}}
# [[by]], [[for]] {{q|of time}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''ко''' [[вторник|вто́рнику]]|'''by''' [[Tuesday]], '''for''' [[Tuesday]]}}
# [[against]] {{q|change of position}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''к''' [[стена|стене́]]|'''against''' the [[wall]]}}

=====Usage notes=====
{{m|ru|ко}} is used before words beginning with certain consonant clusters such as {{m|ru||мн-}}, {{m|ru||вс-}}, {{m|ru||вт-}}, and {{m|ru||сн-}}.

